  "description": "A standalone, general-purpose PostgreSQL-backed job queue for .NET. Producers (any language) insert rows into a shared queued_jobs table; consumers claim work atomically via FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED. Features: lease-based execution, exponential backoff, dead-letter queue, configurable retention, and a hardened raw-SQL producer contract alongside a typed .NET consumer API built on EF Core and Npgsql.",
